     "y": 0.07,
     "width": 0.84,
     "height": 0.22
    }
   ],
   "line": "Take this kiss upon the brow! / And, in parting from you now, / Thus much let me avow — / You are not wrong, who deem / That my days have been a dream;",
   "startMs": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "hope-flown-away",
   "image": "/poetry/dream-within-dream/scenes/02-hope-flown-away.webp",
   "lines": 6,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.35,
    "y": 0.5
   },
   "textPreset": "farewell-drift",
   "transitionMs": 1320,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.1,
     "y": 0.07,
     "width": 0.82,
     "height": 0.24
    }
   ],
   "line": "Yet if hope has flown away / In a night, or in a day, / In a vision, or in none, / Is it therefore the less gone? / All that we see or seem / Is but a dream within a dream.",
   "startMs": 11920
  },
  {
   "id": "golden-sand",
   "image": "/poetry/dream-within-dream/scenes/03-golden-sand.webp",
   "lines": 7,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.5,
    "y": 0.55
   },
   "textPreset": "searchlight-scan",
   "transitionMs": 1200,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.08,
     "width": 0.42,
     "height": 0.24
    }
   ],
   "line": "I stand amid the roar / Of a surf-tormented shore, / And I hold within my hand / Grains of the golden sand — / How few! yet how they creep / Through my fingers to the deep, / While I weep — while I weep!",
   "startMs": 26160
  },
  {
   "id": "dream-within-a-dream",
   "image": "/poetry/dream-within-dream/scenes/04-dream-within-a-dream.webp",
   "lines": 6,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.65,
    "y": 0.4
   },
   "textPreset": "echo-fade",
   "transitionMs": 1500,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.08,
     "y": 0.08,
     "width": 0.42,
     "height": 0.3
    }
   ],
   "line": "O God! Can I not grasp / Them with a tighter clasp? / O God! can I not save / One from the pitiless wave? / Is all that we see or seem / But a dream within a dream?",
   "startMs": 42800
  }
 ],
